Biar makin enak.

01:01:09.533 --> 01:01:10.533
Enggak apa-apa.

01:01:12.466 --> 01:01:13.466
Ayo.

01:01:30.400 --> 01:01:31.633
Enak, kan?

01:01:32.500 --> 01:01:33.500
Enggak apa-apa.

01:01:33.666 --> 01:01:34.666
Malu.

01:01:36.900 --> 01:02:19.966
Nggak perlu malu. Kenapa?

01:02:20.633 --> 01:02:21.633
Jangan.

01:02:28.200 --> 01:02:29.200
Enak, kan?

01:02:29.600 --> 01:02:30.600
Bukan.

01:02:32.966 --> 01:02:33.966
Jangan.

01:02:51.466 --> 01:02:52.900
Lepaskan aku.

01:02:53.600 --> 01:02:54.600
Beneran jangan.

01:03:21.733 --> 01:03:22.733
Jangan sungkan.

01:03:22.900 --> 01:03:23.033
Ayo.

01:03:23.200 --> 01:03:23.666
Lagi.

01:03:23.833 --> 01:03:26.200
Enggak, sudah nggak kuat.

01:03:44.900 --> 01:03:48.466
