01:14:43.933 --> 01:14:45.200
Nggak bisa, nih.

01:14:45.700 --> 01:14:46.966
Mau keluar lagi.

01:14:51.733 --> 01:14:53.566
Ini, makan cepat.

01:14:58.433 --> 01:14:59.733
Nggak bisa.

01:15:01.166 --> 01:15:02.700
